USAGE: retriever outline <subcommand> [options]

Outline wiki commands

SUBCOMMANDS:
  export                    export one Outline document as a Markdown file in the --out folder
  collections               list the collections of the Outline wiki
  documents                 Outline documents commands
  auth                      Outline auth commands
  comments                  Outline comments commands
  revisions                 Outline revisions commands
  shares                    Outline shares commands
  users                     Outline users commands
  groups                    Outline groups commands
  templates                 Outline templates commands
  pins                      Outline pins commands
  stars                     Outline stars commands
  subscriptions             Outline subscriptions commands
  access-requests           Outline access-requests commands
  attachments               Outline attachments commands
  emojis                    Outline emojis commands
  events                    Outline events commands
  file-operations           Outline file-operations commands
  group-memberships         Outline group-memberships commands
  installation              Outline installation commands
  notifications             Outline notifications commands
  oauth-authentications     Outline oauth-authentications commands
  reactions                 Outline reactions commands
  relationships             Outline relationships commands
  searches                  Outline searches commands
  suggestions               Outline suggestions commands
  user-memberships          Outline user-memberships commands
  views                     Outline views commands
  api-keys                  Outline api-keys commands
  authentication-providers  Outline authentication-providers commands
  imports                   Outline imports commands
  integrations              Outline integrations commands
  oauth-clients             Outline oauth-clients commands
  webhook-subscriptions     Outline webhook-subscriptions commands
  teams                     Outline teams commands
  tree                      show the document tree of one Outline collection

OPTIONS:
  -h, --help  show help

EXIT STATUS:
  0    the command completed
  2    the command did not complete: a usage mistake, a configuration error, or a failed request
  124  a bounded wait elapsed before the command finished; the failure is retryable
  125  the environment refused before the command started, such as a port already in use

