USAGE: retriever outline documents search <query> [--offset <n>] [--limit <n>] [--source <id>]

search Outline documents by title and text, one page at a time

ARGUMENTS:
  <query>

OPTIONS:
  --offset <n>   the first match to return; 0 when omitted
  --limit <n>    matches per page, from 1 to 100; 25 when omitted
  --source <id>  configured source ID; required when more than one outline source exists
  -h, --help     show help

